; The runtime's (ppc_overrides.h):
?DOA4QueryTimeBase@@YA_KXZ
?GuestTrap@@YAXAEAUPPCContext@@PEAEII@Z
?GuestSwitchOutOfRange@@YAXII@Z
PPCStoreMiss
PPCJmpBuf
; The C runtime's, which the shims in include/ declare: the executable's own (static) C runtime, so the generated code
